{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"natlan_collective_plenty","name_zh":"沃陆之邦","name_en":"Collective of Plenty","aliases":["沃陆之邦","Collective of Plenty","Teteocan"],"category":"society","scope":"regional","regions":["Natlan"],"summary":"沃陆之邦（Collective of Plenty，又称Teteocan）是纳塔六部族之一，位于Atocpan的Great Volcano of Tollan附近。该部族重视体魄，以健身、力量竞赛及与Tatankasaurus角力等传统闻名；现任首领为Acatl。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"natlan_collective_plenty_fact_01","text":"沃陆之邦是纳塔六部族之一，也称Teteocan。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现今","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_collective_plenty"]},{"fact_id":"natlan_collective_plenty_fact_02","text":"沃陆之邦位于Atocpan的Great Volcano of Tollan附近，并且是距离Stadium of the Sacred Flame最远的部族。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现今","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_collective_plenty"]},{"fact_id":"natlan_collective_plenty_fact_03","text":"沃陆之邦以健美比赛和力量竞赛闻名。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期延续至今","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_collective_plenty"]},{"fact_id":"natlan_collective_plenty_fact_04","text":"当地流传的说法认为，沃陆之邦的水果和蔬菜是纳塔最好的，这被归因于部族邻近Great Volcano of Tollan、土壤肥沃。","status":"reported","temporal_scope":"现今","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_collective_plenty"]},{"fact_id":"natlan_collective_plenty_fact_05","text":"部分沃陆之邦战士会主动寻找野生Halberd-Crest Bird，比试谁的头更坚硬，并试图借此锤炼身体。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期习俗","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_collective_plenty"]},{"fact_id":"natlan_collective_plenty_fact_06","text":"与Tatankasaurus角力是沃陆之邦的悠久传统，战胜它们被视为极大的荣誉。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期习俗","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_collective_plenty"]},{"fact_id":"natlan_collective_plenty_fact_07","text":"沃陆之邦高度重视身体素质；年轻人展示肌肉可被视为友好举动，健身教练也必须拥有极强的体魄才能得到认真对待，因此许多成年人身材高大、肌肉发达。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现今的社会风俗","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_collective_plenty"]},{"fact_id":"natlan_collective_plenty_fact_08","text":"沃陆之邦由Ahpub于数千年前、约在Grand Alliance时期建立。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"数千年前","visibility":"specialist_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_collective_plenty"]},{"fact_id":"natlan_collective_plenty_fact_09","text":"沃陆之邦现任首领为Acatl。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现今","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_collective_plenty"]}],"timeline":[{"period":"数千年前，约在Grand Alliance时期","order_hint":10,"events":["Ahpub建立沃陆之邦。"],"current_status":"部族延续至今；证据未提供更精确的建立日期。","source_ids":["fandom_natlan_collective_plenty"]}],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"在纳塔，沃陆之邦可被认识为六部族之一，并以强健体魄、力量竞赛、健身文化和肥沃土地上的农产品闻名。","likely_known_by":["沃陆之邦成员","纳塔境内熟悉各部族的人","曾接触该部族竞赛、健身文化或农产品的人"],"unlikely_known_by":[],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":["沃陆之邦的水果和蔬菜被称为纳塔最好，但现有证据仅将其表述为一种评价或传闻，不能视为经过客观比较确认的事实。"]},"activation_keys":["沃陆之邦","Collective of Plenty"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["可玩角色分类、角色卡片列表等页面模板性内容。"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["Ahpub“可能被焚烧”的括注带有推测性，未纳入事实。"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_natlan_collective_plenty","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Collective of Plenty","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Collective_of_Plenty","language":"en","revision_id":"2116221","source_text_sha256":"253bdc215c531a08ea2662b1eed995848fe771e98629f9f11bb3bbb0feec2d25"}],"evidence_bundle_sha256":"29ed9f879bcf62b13008d316bbbecba3cca8a49c49e05d0f96d2b87a784f9157","review":{"cross_language_conflicts":[],"uncertain_claims":["“沃陆之邦的水果和蔬菜是纳塔最好的”属于传闻性评价，已标记为reported。"],"missing_evidence":["BWiki的“沃陆之邦”核验页不存在，无法核对Teteocan及其他英文专名的中文正式译名。"],"needs_human_review":true}}